      "content": "I'm not sure what you mean by \"summoning a goblin\" or why you're talking about cookies. I need a professional diagnostic, not jokes. \n\nYou mentioned dampers—how do I actually test if the zone damper for that bedroom is failing electronically versus mechanically? And what's the next thing on that list after dampers?",
